<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
    body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: #222222;
        background-color: transparent;
        margin: 20px;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body {
            color: #E6E6E6;
        }
        .highlight {
            color: #FF8800;
        }
        .box {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        }
    }
    h1 {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    h2 {
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .highlight {
        color: #E65100;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .box {
        background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        margin-top: 14px;
    }
    ul {
        margin: 6px 0 6px 18px;
        padding: 0;
    }
    li {
        margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Welcome to toolboy's <span class="highlight">@TB_PRODUCT_NAME@</span></h1>
    <p>This installer will install the <strong>@TB_PRODUCT_NAME@</strong> audio plugins onto your Mac.</p>

    <div class="box">
        <h2>Included Plug-In Formats:</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Audio Units (AU)</strong>: <code>/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/@TB_PRODUCT_NAME@.component</code></li>
            <li><strong>VST3</strong>: <code>/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/@TB_PRODUCT_NAME@.vst3</code></li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top: 18px;">Click <strong>Continue</strong> to proceed with the installation.</p>
</body>
</html>

